      "betaEditorialReason": "The absence of fear and grief is a good outcome; the negated bad states must not make the clauses dotted.",
      "start": 10242,
      "end": 10282,
      "sourceText": "لَا خَوْفٌ عَلَيْكُمُ الْيَوْمَ"
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-u-43-68-2",
      "text": "شماست و نه اندوهگین می شوید؛",
      "logicalText": "لا أنتم تحزنون",
      "textHash": "40c8940b38d5673cf46baf147eb824a25ebfe8ce5c1581b6c04bbe73de1ae778",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(8) > p:nth-of-type(2) > span:nth-of-type(4)",
