      },
      "betaEditorialReason": "The absence of fear and grief is a good outcome; the negated bad states must not make the clauses dotted.",
      "start": 10285,
      "end": 10315,
      "sourceText": "لَا أَنتُمْ تَحْزَنُونَ"
    },
    {
      "id": "beta-u-43-69-3",
      "text": "آیات ما ایمان آوردند و همواره",
      "logicalText": "آمنوا بآياتنا",
